24lo|a|Existing or being everywhere, or in all places, at the same time; omnipresent.	j:edm,73,2~edm,73,2	e:1lgp,50,5;1d28,37,3;6vj,15,1;1awf,11,3~1lgp,50,5;1awf,11,3;1d28,37,3;6vj,15,1
24lp|n|Existence everywhere, or in places, at the same time; omnipresence; as, the ubiquity of God is not disputed by those who admit his existence. ; The doctrine, as formulated by Luther, that Christ's glorified body is omnipresent.	N:1ldj,110,5~1ldj,110,5
